# CHANGED HERE:
#   Map        wired to /api/v1/repo-map/scan + /search (phase 1 step 7, built long ago,
#              consumed by no page until now) — languages, manifests, entry points, symbol
#              index, dependency map, plus a literal search box. Read-only, workspace-scoped.
#   Problems   nothing new fetched: refused steps, an unclean shadow comparison and
#              contradicted claims already arrive on plan()/approve() -- this panel had
#              simply never rendered them. Fixed a real bug found writing it: executor.mjs
#              returns `performed`/`refused` as COUNTS, not arrays -- treating a `0` count
#              as `?? []` does nothing (nullish coalescing does not touch a defined 0), and
#              `for...of` on that bare number threw "0 is not iterable" the first time a
#              clean run reached this panel. Caught by the browser suite before this shipped
#              (see the two FAILs recorded in this phase's session transcript, not repeated
#              in a decision entry since the fix landed same-session and the suite is green).
#   Editor,    view-only renderings of the current run's files (proposed before Approve,
