#              second write path: every real change still goes only through Plan -> Approve,
#              so a live edit box here would let a byte reach the workspace without a plan,
#              a token or a shadow comparison -- the exact chain the rest of this page
#              enforces. Preview renders HTML in a sandboxed ("") srcdoc iframe -- a rendered
#              artefact, never executable content from the workspace.
