#              this is the causal trail of a run the caller already holds the object for, not
#              the aggregate audit view `audit.read` gates. An unknown id returns an empty
#              trail, not 404: the ledger cannot distinguish "no such run" from "recorded
#              nothing yet", and inventing that distinction would claim knowledge the route
#              does not have. New adversarial test in workspace-actions-http-adversarial.test.mjs.
