#                       and DELETE "permanently and on purpose"; this image does not reopen
#                       that boundary under pressure to "finish" the workbench.
#   Terminal / the      needs a real session protocol over a unix socket and an attached
#   CodeN Evolution TUI shell -- a distinct subsystem the product's own design docs already
#                       treat as separate, later work, not a panel to bolt on in one image.
#   The model-in-the-   still the Owner's decision from D-0228 (which of the ten
